      <li><strong>Core Technologies:</strong> Python (FastAPI, scikit-learn, PyTorch, LangChain/LangGraph, LiteLLM), GCP (Vertex AI, Cloud Run, BigQuery, Cloud Storage), Docker, MLflow, dbt, Memgraph, Claude Code, Bitbucket.</li>
